 50: 3. **Place once.** The swap is `flushSync(() => setScene(next))`, so the new scene, the hero, and its layout effect commit inside the swap callback. The hero computes its placement in a `useLayoutEffect` keyed on `[entry, project, lanefield, viewport]` and never re-tracks per frame.
