 52: 5. **Anchor is the mark.** The hero registers a screen anchor (center, ring radius, silhouette radius); the engine ground-projects it through the current camera each frame. Ring radius = `max(pad, min(halfExtent + hero.ringPadPx, clearance))`, so the bulge never reaches the readout, the name zone, or the keymap.
