324: - Hold threshold equals the LeafLink tap limit, so a LeafLink tap (shorter) still drops an offer and a hold never does.
325: - Moving `world.leaflink.tapMaxMovePx` or more before activation cancels (that gesture is not a hold).
326: - Once active, moving stirs: the ring follows the pointer.
327: - Off under reduced motion, while a sheet is open, and during travel (the engine refuses then as well).
328: - The g key ignores modifiers, repeats, and editable focus.
329: - `#world canvas` gets `-webkit-touch-callout: none` and `user-select: none`, so iOS gives the hold to the page.
