  2: // Timing note, same as the W4 suite: on SwiftShader a single frame
  3: // takes many seconds, so a 700ms travel jumps from start to finish
  4: // in one frame. Browser tests therefore assert endpoints, settled
  5: // invariants, and DOM timing, never a mid-travel wall-clock pixel
  6: // sample; interpolation at 0, 25, 50, 75, 100 percent is covered by
