266:   // bit for bit; ring strength can differ in the last float digits
267:   // because the absolute page time at the first key press depends on
268:   // how long the layout worker took (wall time), and the engine's
269:   // (t - start) arithmetic rounds differently on a different base.
270:   expect(a.length).toBe(b.length);
