   1: // LeafLink scene controller (S06). Owns the heartbeat simulation
   2: // (spawns, landings, matches, routes, halos, fades) and the pin, halo
   3: // and ripple meshes. Routes are drawn by the lane shader through
   4: // lanefield.setActivity with kind 1; this file draws no route mesh.
   5: //
   6: // Simulation timing uses the lanefield clock and a short interval, not
   7: // the frame loop, so spawn and match times stay wall-clock true even
   8: // when frames are slow. Rendering attributes refresh on every frame
   9: // and on every interval tick.
  10: //
  11: // The graph comes from the layout generator (layouts/leaflink.ts),
  12: // run once here with a scratch buffer, so the controller never needs
  13: // worker side data plumbed through the engine.
