 13: // S03 section 4: travel choreography. Durations and switch points come
 14: // from T (DESIGN chrome.travelDom and motion). Transitions use the
 15: // generated CSS custom properties, never literal durations or easings,
 16: // so lint-tokens stays clean.
 17: 
 18: // S03 section 4 table, readout enter: opacity 0 to 1 and translateY 8px
 19: // to 0. The 8px is the spec's choreography constant (S03 section 4);
 20: // it is not a DESIGN token, so it is cited here, not invented.
 21: const READOUT_ENTER_SHIFT_PX = 8;
