186:     // S05 T-SRV-2 measures every pixel that is NOT text. The wired
187:     // server controller spawns words that drift into the readout box,
188:     // so pause it first: pause fades the word pool out over
189:     // duration-fast, leaving only lanes and ground to measure.
190:     // The pause does not freeze the lanefield itself: a transient
191:     // (a warp pulse or fade residual, a faint dark-blue speck) can
192:     // linger in the box for seconds after pause. It is present 1s
193:     // after pause and gone by 6s (measured 2026-10-30), so wait
194:     // 6000ms for the steady state, not 1000ms. Threshold unchanged.
