  6: // the attribute sits on the single wrapper element.
  7: //
  8: // Markup and fallback chain are unchanged from W6: a picture element
  9: // whose reduced-motion source is the first-frame PNG and whose img is
 10: // the animated GIF (SideQuests) or the logo PNG (LeafLink). F0 GIF,
