 37: //    motion.morph.recede (complete before its DOM unmounts at the swap).
 38: //    The old component ignored both, so marks popped in and out.
 39: // 4. Stage grammar (src/motion/stage.ts): subject recedes the mark and
 40: //    pans the camera so the subject sits in the mark's clear spot;
 41: //    land sends a pulse from the subject into the mark and looms it
