 341: ## 8. World constants (the Lanefield)
 342: 
 343: All geometry is in world units (1 unit reads as 1 meter). Exact values are in section 12 under `world`. Summary:
 344: 
 345: - Lane count 6144. Points per lane 8. Segments per lane 7. Instances 43,008. Layout count 4.
 346: - Layout texture: RGBA32F, 256 by 768 texels. Texel index `lane * 32 + layout * 8 + point`. RGB position, A class id.
 347: - Activity texture: RGBA32F, 256 by 24 texels, one texel per lane.
 348: - Lane width is in CSS pixels, per class. Lines thinner than 1 device pixel are drawn at 1 device pixel with alpha scaled by their true width (no shimmer).
 349: - Camera poses per scene and per breakpoint, principal-point shift so the subject sits beside the readout.
