1127: - 1.0.4, 2026-10-30: server fine shiftNdc x 0.58 to 0.62. The 0.58 pose passed T-SRV-2 once but failed twice after (0.047, 0.61) because idle yaw (3 deg) plus pointer parallax (1.5 deg) can combine to ~4.5 deg of left rotation, and the 0.58 margin (58px) does not survive it: geometric sweep to +/-5 deg shows 310 lane segments in the box at yaw -5 deg for 0.58. Shift 0.62 is clear at every yaw to +/-5 deg (minX 617 at yaw 0, zero hits at worst yaw), so it survives max yaw plus max parallax. Output point moves to ~1471px (31px past the right edge); server words drift left ~135px from the output, so they still enter view as they cool.
